WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.191 --> 00:00:04.923
("Bon-Vacance" by AudioNetwork)

00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:06.673
- Stupid.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:07.353
- Hey, what's up?

00:00:07.353 --> 00:00:08.833
- I hate my new boss.

00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:10.353
- You hate all of your bosses.

00:00:10.353 --> 00:00:12.893
- No, this guy is the fucking worst.

00:00:12.893 --> 00:00:15.133
I have to wear this stupid...

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:15.913
- Jabot.

00:00:15.913 --> 00:00:16.633
- What?

00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:17.703
- Well it's called a jabot.

00:00:17.703 --> 00:00:20.224
- It's stupid and the freaking

00:00:20.224 --> 00:00:23.313
night shift is killing me.

00:00:23.313 --> 00:00:25.164
- Well hey, you start at the
bottom with the night shift

00:00:25.164 --> 00:00:26.944
and you work your way up the day shift.

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:28.464
- I don't think there is a day shift.

00:00:28.464 --> 00:00:30.984
This guy is a weirdo, okay.

00:00:30.984 --> 00:00:33.084
His skin is all pale and chalky.

00:00:33.084 --> 00:00:35.824
He looks like a crispy powdered donut.

00:00:35.824 --> 00:00:36.564
- Ew.

00:00:36.564 --> 00:00:38.084
- I know, I don't think he gets out much.

00:00:38.084 --> 00:00:40.164
He's like 4,000 years old.

00:00:40.164 --> 00:00:41.484
- Stop complaining 'cause I would do

00:00:41.484 --> 00:00:43.064
anything for a job right now.

00:00:43.064 --> 00:00:44.004
- Not this guy, I mean,

00:00:44.004 --> 00:00:45.604
I can handle a micro-manager but it's like

00:00:45.604 --> 00:00:47.824
every time I get up, he's
just been standing there

00:00:47.824 --> 00:00:49.324
the whole time, breathing down my neck,

00:00:49.324 --> 00:00:51.704
like, (heaving breathing)

00:00:51.704 --> 00:00:53.964
and then there's this
awful moth ball smell.

00:00:53.964 --> 00:00:56.184
I don't know if it's just
when he's in bat form

00:00:56.184 --> 00:00:58.584
or he's standing right
behind me, isn't he?

00:00:58.584 --> 00:00:59.864
(suspenseful music)

00:01:02.944 --> 00:01:06.444
- Don't worry, we've got
the good health insurance.

00:01:06.444 --> 00:01:09.124
- Whatever, as long as
I can log these hours.

00:01:10.074 --> 00:01:12.064
- You know, some people
would kill to work from home.

00:01:12.064 --> 00:01:13.164
- Are you A positive?

00:01:13.164 --> 00:01:14.544
You go great with Malibu.

00:01:14.544 --> 00:01:19.434
("Bon-vacance" by AudioNetwork)

00:01:20.724 --> 00:01:23.464
- Oh and thanks for the
Coppertone SPF a billion.

00:01:23.464 --> 00:01:25.164
- Anything to keep my boss alive.

00:01:25.164 --> 00:01:27.474
- I am, I am alive.

